(module aslHarness/configurableBrowserHarnessTest :x [testBrowserExecutionContextInstantiation testDynamicHarnessRouting testSpecializedHarnessPreset testPresetExecutionPlanGeneration testThreadProfileEvaluation testTranspilePresetToBrowser testCanonicalAsnFormatting runTests] :i [(configurableBrowserHarness :a cbh)])

fn testBrowserExecutionContextInstantiation -> Bool
  (let [(ctxSingle (cbh/makeBrowserExecutionContext "single-thread" "main" 0 false)) (ctxMulti (cbh/makeBrowserExecutionContext "multi-thread" "worker-1" 4 true))] (assert (= ctxSingle.mode "single-thread") "Single thread mode must match") (assert (= ctxSingle.threadId "main") "Main thread ID must match") (assert (not ctxSingle.sharedBufferSupported) "Shared buffer false in single thread") (assert (= ctxMulti.mode "multi-thread") "Multi thread mode must match") (assert (= ctxMulti.workerCount 4) "Worker count must be 4") (assert ctxMulti.sharedBufferSupported "Shared buffer true in multi thread") true)

fn testDynamicHarnessRouting -> Bool
  (let [(rToys (cbh/routeDynamicHarness "toys")) (rWeb (cbh/routeDynamicHarness "websites")) (rSvg (cbh/routeDynamicHarness "svgs")) (rNano (cbh/routeDynamicHarness "nano")) (rMicro (cbh/routeDynamicHarness "micro"))] (assert (= rToys.modelId "qwen2.5:3b-instruct") "Toys must route to 3B ceiling") (assert (= rToys.tier "browser-ceiling-slm") "Toys tier must be browser-ceiling-slm") (assert (= rToys.fsmDepth 16) "Toys FSM depth must be 16") (assert (= rToys.executionMode "multi-thread") "Toys execution must be multi-thread") (assert (= rWeb.modelId "qwen2.5:1.5b") "Websites must route to 1.5B") (assert (= rSvg.modelId "qwen2.5:1.5b") "SVGs must route to 1.5B") (assert (= rSvg.executionMode "single-thread") "SVGs can run single-thread") (assert (= rNano.modelId "hanse-nano:100m") "Nano must route to 100M") (assert (= rNano.schemaTokens 30) "Nano schema overhead must be 30 tokens") (assert (= rMicro.modelId "qwen2.5:0.5b") "Micro must route to 0.5B") true)

fn testSpecializedHarnessPreset -> Bool
  (let [(preset (cbh/makeSpecializedHarnessPreset "preset-01" "cat-svgs" "small-slm-edge" "qwen2.5:1.5b" "single-thread" "Emit standard ASN vector representation. Never emit markdown." 8))] (assert (= preset.presetId "preset-01") "Preset ID must match") (assert (= preset.category "cat-svgs") "Category must match") (assert (= preset.targetTier "small-slm-edge") "Tier must match") (assert (= preset.fsmMaskDepth 8) "FSM mask depth must match") true)

fn testPresetExecutionPlanGeneration -> Bool
  (let [(planToy (cbh/generatePresetExecutionPlan "p-1" "toy-life" "toys" "(:step 1)" "application/json")) (planSvg (cbh/generatePresetExecutionPlan "p-2" "svg-badge" "svgs" "(:badge)" "image/svg+xml"))] (assert (= planToy.planId "p-1") "Plan ID must match") (assert (= planToy.maxTokens 512) "Toy max tokens must be 512") (assert (= planToy.expectedFormat "application/json") "Toy format must match") (assert (= planSvg.maxTokens 256) "SVG max tokens must be 256") (assert (= planSvg.expectedFormat "image/svg+xml") "SVG format must match") true)

fn testThreadProfileEvaluation -> Bool
  (let [(profMulti (cbh/evaluateExecutionThreadProfile "multi-thread" "browser-ceiling-slm")) (profSingleCeil (cbh/evaluateExecutionThreadProfile "single-thread" "browser-ceiling-slm")) (profNano (cbh/evaluateExecutionThreadProfile "single-thread" "nano-slm"))] (assert profMulti.fps60Guaranteed "Multi-thread must guarantee 60fps") (assert (= profMulti.uiFrameDropRisk "none") "Multi-thread frame drop risk is none") (assert (= profMulti.memoryOverheadMb 32) "Multi-thread memory overhead is 32MB") (assert (not profSingleCeil.fps60Guaranteed) "Single-thread 3B cannot guarantee 60fps") (assert (= profSingleCeil.uiFrameDropRisk "high") "Single-thread 3B risk is high") (assert profNano.fps60Guaranteed "Single-thread nano guarantees 60fps") (assert (= profNano.estimatedLatencyMs 12) "Nano latency must be 12ms") true)

fn testTranspilePresetToBrowser -> Bool
  (let [(outSvg (cbh/transpilePresetToBrowser "out-1" "vector-diagram" "(:rc :x 0 :y 0 :w 10 :h 10)")) (outVdom (cbh/transpilePresetToBrowser "out-2" "vdom-page" "(:tag \"main\")")) (outToy (cbh/transpilePresetToBrowser "out-3" "cellular-automata" "(:grid [1 0])"))] (assert outSvg.success "SVG transpilation must succeed") (assert (= outSvg.targetFormat "image/svg+xml") "SVG MIME format must match") (assert (stringContains? outSvg.renderedOutput "<svg xmlns=") "Must contain SVG tag") (assert outVdom.success "VDOM transpilation must succeed") (assert (= outVdom.targetFormat "text/html") "HTML MIME format must match") (assert (stringContains? outVdom.renderedOutput "<div class=\"vdom-container\">") "Must wrap in container") (assert outToy.success "Toy transpilation must succeed") (assert (= outToy.targetFormat "application/json") "JSON MIME format must match") true)

fn testCanonicalAsnFormatting -> Bool
  (let [(route (cbh/routeDynamicHarness "nano")) (plan (cbh/generatePresetExecutionPlan "p-1" "toy-1" "toys" "input" "json")) (prof (cbh/evaluateExecutionThreadProfile "multi-thread" "small-slm-edge")) (strRoute (cbh/formatDynamicRouteAsn route)) (strPlan (cbh/formatPresetPlanAsn plan)) (strProf (cbh/formatThreadProfileAsn prof))] (assert (stringContains? strRoute ":capability \"nano\"") "Route ASN must contain capability") (assert (stringContains? strRoute ":schema-tokens 30") "Route ASN must contain tokens") (assert (stringContains? strPlan ":plan-id \"p-1\"") "Plan ASN must contain plan-id") (assert (stringContains? strProf ":mode \"multi-thread\"") "Profile ASN must contain mode") (assert (stringContains? strProf ":fps60-guaranteed true") "Profile ASN must contain 60fps flag") true)

fn runTests -> Bool
  (and (testBrowserExecutionContextInstantiation) (and (testDynamicHarnessRouting) (and (testSpecializedHarnessPreset) (and (testPresetExecutionPlanGeneration) (and (testThreadProfileEvaluation) (and (testTranspilePresetToBrowser) (testCanonicalAsnFormatting)))))))
